# Used by `npm run build` (Vite reads .env.production for a production build).
#
# Where the console's API lives. The console is a static site (Catalyst
# Slate): it cannot answer /api itself, so without this every sign-in is posted to
# the static host and comes back 405 or 404. This is a URL, not a secret: it is
# baked into the page and anyone can read it. A host's own environment setting
# (VITE_API_BASE in the Slate dashboard) overrides it.
#
# If the API ever moves, change this line and rebuild.
VITE_API_BASE=https://ksm-admin-api.onrender.com
